\b Maria Price - has a 0 to 100 meter and a metered connection.\par
\b0 -> any info about sexual orientation and refusal to change, any leaving abruptly or influencing both kids to leave her will break her and will make her not like you. Or for example if you refuse to work and provide for the family. Her relationship can be restored to a point if you return home and have a job or promise to find one, respect her directives, though she ll never be the same and relation can easily break off again, completely. (also if its about the job from the start, just find a job!) With sexual orientation, the second you turn around to listen to her, and influencing the kids has no solution, she will not accept what you did to her with both kids. \par
- she can be perfect, green meter for community if:\par
->your relation is higher, it starts at 70, normally needed: at least 90\par
->both kids follow mother advice, here you're important to teach them this way\par
->follow certain path\par
With your mother in the frame, she will ask for example not to go to London, you can listen to her [this is the way anyway, +15], you can confess your sexuality and ask for help, or be caught and side with her argument [zero change, it's -50, but it can be negated if you agree to her ideas, doing that might even negate being committed if you're lucky with the first doctor called in]. You will be asked then to simply get rid of bohemian things, of art and of the journal.\par
Otherwise, you can do it yourself in silence, removing these to not be caught, suppressing your thoughts. Listening to her or doing these alone will give  her relationship +10.\par
Listening what job she recommends will give +5. \par
She will ask you to come to Church with her, that's +15.\par
If you listen to all advice, and fight your thoughts while daydreaming, you eliminate yourself and gain a secret cutscene with your mother being proud of you, the bar goes green and you are now "happy". The bar for community goes green.\par
OTHERWISE. If you choose to continue your routine, no visible change in points. If you leave for London it's -5, but going to Paris will be -15. \par
If you're caught gay and refuse to change, -50. Refusing to go to Church with her is -5. She will not kick you out if the stat is too low, however, it's necessary for a special ending.\par
\b Talia Price - has a 0 to 100 meter, starts at 60.\par
\b0 -> very straightforward: depends on the rest. If you move both older sister and younger brother from the mother, she will be pissed, -50 and she will avoid talking to you anymore. Otherwise, she is willing to help with some money and a place to stay in London, where you can spend time with her, encourage her on her dreams and try to be nice in dialogue +20 if so. Especially if you help her back afterwards, she will ask for couple favors. \par
+3 for every visit you give her and spend time with her and her husband. That way, if it reaches 100, you can tell her more openly about your plans, if you pursue an independence self route. You can tell them your artistic inclinations. However her husband wont react well to your sexuality, choose option to tell her in private. Nevertheless, you feel at home there.\par
If you separated too violently from the family, the relation will be blocked at 50, because she still cares about her mother, even if less. She will tell in this case you visited her and even leak details about your life, thread carefully! She is torn  between helping and being independent when it comes to her mother. +10 in relations if you maintain good relations with your family while in London or even Paris. \par
\b Austin Price - Has a 0 to 100 meter, starts at 50.\par
\b0 -> pretty straight forward: spend time with him. He will naturally gravitate towards his mother, learning how to be a "man", but, by spending time with him, you can influence him.\par
He starts as +2 towards mother, but you can make him lean -2 for you. He wants to escape poverty but does not know how. He hates his life here and is kinda hoping for more. \par
By spending time with him, for each hour,it increases the meter by +3. Visiting him every now and then if you left, +2. -20 if you leave him, +1 for every letter you send per week, up to +20 to counter balance initial loss. The relation degrades up to 40 via -1 per week where you did not interact at all with him. He' ll just be indifferent. Buying him toys will give +3 per toy [toys like chess table, a ship replica, old trinkets, deck of cards, pocket knives or watch, books]. \par
+5 if you take his side in an argument where his mother tells him that he will be like the rest, working in a  factory, -10 against the mother if you choose to protect him. -2 if you choose not to take his side and remain silent.\par
For each level of trust, you can teach the kid a thing or two, and push him away from his mother. \par
at +2, you can tell him to not be violent towards women and people, to be kind.\par
at +1, you can choose either to advise him to be independent or that the only way out is by being independent (big difference)\par
at 0, you can discuss with him about dreams, here , you can encourage him to be an artist, or, simply seek for himself\par
at -1 you can choose or not to be open about the reality of finding a woman, telling him its okay if you dont want it, and that  you are open to help him if needed; or encourage him to seek it at his own pace\par
at -2 you can tell him the truth about yourself, he will accept it. \par
If you chose options to influence him hard, especially about yourself, to be artistic or leave, he will remember that. He will ask to leave with you, your mother will disagree, you have to choose which will receive -20 and which +20. This will also mean you need to assist him as well.\par
If you told him to be an artist, depends how honest you were about challenges to him, if you sold him the idea of all being glitter or better, he might resent listening to you if you fail to provide for him or teach him to be independent. \par
If you told him he does not need to seek a woman and you are ready to help, he feels like not wanting to do it now, but will tell his mother by mistake, putting you to test if you hold your ground, accept Mother's suggestion to walk back on it, or to try to push him away from the mother. \par
Accepting is +5 mother, -10 with him and loss of trust on the advice, sustaining your point is -20 with mother, +5 with him, teaching him courage to stand up to his mother, essential for final break from her influence to come to live with you, in case you leave without him, or, accepting but behind her back you tell him that she cannot be trusted. Creates a rupture and your mother wont forget, -20. \par
The levels of attachment are:\par
60 -> +1\par
70 -> 0\par
85 -> -1\par
100 -> -2\par
You can also pick options to quell his passions, to align with the mother, -10 for each, in total, 3 times, so that it forces max 70 relationship, but kid will begrudgingly agree with it. \par
